{"unit_id":"slow-stack__euthyna#card-zh","repo":"slow-stack/euthyna","commit":"a78af23e14e63b3c801f4729275737a5945475df","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"euthyna 是面向 AI 编程代理的 DSH 代码审计插件，提供可加载的审计技能和配套命令行工具。插件把包内技能注册到 DSH 技能目录，并添加 /euthyna 使用说明命令；命令行可整理 Git 变更中删除代码的来源、查询覆盖率数据中的符号调用情况、读取锁文件依赖版本，并按统一格式合并审计报告。用户可以单独运行 history、coverage、deps 或 gate，也可用 audit 汇总变更和依赖信息。适合希望让代理按明确流程检查代码变更、并保存结构化结果的开发者。需要 Node.js 20 及 Git；不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.js:48-88","src/cli.js:88-120","src/cli.js:818-890"]}
{"unit_id":"slow-stack__euthyna#card-en","repo":"slow-stack/euthyna","commit":"a78af23e14e63b3c801f4729275737a5945475df","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"euthyna adds an audit skill and /euthyna help command to DSH. Its CLI traces deleted Git lines, looks up symbols in coverage reports, reads locked dependency versions, and checks report structure. The audit command combines change and dependency facts. Requires Node.js 20 and Git.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.js:48-88","src/cli.js:88-120","src/cli.js:818-890"]}
